WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.788
Kip felt awful.

2
00:00:14.789 --> 00:00:21.751
He left the pizza crust on his branch.

3
00:00:21.752 --> 00:00:25.929
He went into his hole.

4
00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:32.279
"Bird doesn't want a pizza crust," he thought.

5
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:46.810
"She wants noodle soup, blankets, and tea."

6
00:00:46.811 --> 00:00:53.747
Kip made noodle soup and tea.

7
00:00:53.748 --> 00:00:59.180
He found some blankets.

8
00:00:59.181 --> 00:01:17.855
"I'll bring these things to Bird," he said.

9
00:01:17.856 --> 00:01:23.325
"Hi, Bird," said Kip.

10
00:01:23.326 --> 00:01:28.177
"Ah-choo!" said Bird.

11
00:01:28.178 --> 00:01:32.207
"I brought you some things," said Kip.

12
00:01:32.208 --> 00:01:35.333
Kip gave the soup and the tea to Bird.

13
00:01:35.334 --> 00:01:38.468
Kip put the blankets over Bird's feet.

14
00:01:38.469 --> 00:01:43.108
"Thanks, Kip," said Bird.

15
00:01:43.109 --> 00:01:47.149
Then Bird noticed the pizza crust.

16
00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:49.486
"Oh!" said Bird.

17
00:01:49.487 --> 00:01:52.925
"Is that pizza crust for me too?"

18
00:01:52.926 --> 00:01:55.993
Kip was surprised.

19
00:01:55.994 --> 00:02:05.944
"Um, yes," said Kip.

20
00:02:05.945 --> 00:02:09.534
"It is for you."

21
00:02:09.535 --> 00:02:16.102
"Pizza crust is my favorite," said Bird.

22
00:02:16.103 --> 00:02:22.869
"You know just what I like, Kip!"

23
00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:30.726
"Mmm," said Bird. "I'm feeling better already!"

24
00:02:30.727 --> 00:02:32.351
Kip smiled.

25
00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:38.697
He was feeling better too.

